name: ra_leakage_found
dataset: ra_leakage_dataset
measure: count
comparator: gte
threshold: 1
severity: CRITICAL
description: "A revenue-assurance control found leakage (re-rating, roll-forward or settlement). It fires once for the rule, not per control; the rows name the control. Runbook: config/runbooks/telco-ra-runbooks.md, the control's section."
